        },
        ["long"] = new()
        {
            ["bullets"] = "- Major AI labs (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Meta) have invested billions in LLMs that serve millions of users\n- AI coding tools like GitHub Copilot and Claude Code boost productivity 30-55% on tasks like code review, debugging, and documentation\n- Hallucination in high-stakes domains (healthcare, legal) remains a critical unsolved problem\n- Energy consumption for training and inference raises sustainability concerns\n- Organizations struggle with AI governance frameworks\n- Smaller edge-capable models and multi-modal AI are driving the next wave\n- Integration with robotics and autonomous systems promises further advances\n- Scientific research is being accelerated by AI-assisted discovery",
